edits_description = "The people and stalls were cut out to be used in a composition."
blurb = "Like the rest of the series, this print depicts famous theatrical characters comically reimagined at a market.

The shop in the top right of the image is a dōguya (道具屋, \"tool shop\"), which sold various household implements, utensils, and tools. However, they often also functioned as general dealers of second-hand items."
